SUMMARY:🌙 Night English & Tech Review • Day 1 🔥
DESCRIPTION:📖 OPEN IN EDITORIAL MAGAZINE: https://prince-task-agent.onrender.com/read\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🗣️ ACTIVE ENGLISH CONVERSATION DRILL:\n• Sentence Building: Use resilient in a sentence explaining your backend code.\n• Common Mistake vs Native: Do not say I am having 2 years experience\, say I have 2 years of experience.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n⚡ TECH INSIGHT (DSA & ASP.NET Core):\n• ASP.NET Core Dependency Injection Lifetimes: Transient (every request gets a new instance)\, Scoped (shared across a single HTTP request)\, Singleton (single instance shared across application lifetime).\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🎯 REST WELL:\nStay consistent every day. Great engineers are built one day at a time!
